  "message": "Idempotency ensures that identical requests produce the same result, even if sent multiple times. For payments, the `Idempotency-Key` header must be included in the request. If the same key is used with the same request body, the system returns the original payment (201) without processing a duplicate. If a different request body is used with the same key, a 409 Conflict is returned. This prevents duplicate charges and ensures consistency.",
